  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/933",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">안녕하세요,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">생물의 다양성 단원 복습용 게임입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">링크 들어가셔서 사용하시면 됩니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1. 동물 2048 / 식물 2048</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">2048 게임을 적용한 생물 2048 입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">조작법</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">방향키 / WASD / 터치로 스와이프</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">3가지 입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75c7d64cbf606bb034599318224fd239ecc58fb3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75c7d64cbf606bb034599318224fd239ecc58fb3\" data-origin-width=\"430\" data-origin-height=\"613\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/생물과-다양성\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/생물과-다양성/생물의-구성-단계-2048동물</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"우T의 과학 - 생물과 다양성\" data-og-description=\"생물과 다양성\" data-og-host=\"sites.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/생물과-다양성\" data-og-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/생물과-다양성\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/생물과-다양성\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">우T의 과학 - 생물과 다양성</p><p class=\"og-desc\">생물과 다양성</p><p class=\"og-host\">sites.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">한자로 된 버전이 있어서<br>한국어 버전으로 만들었습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"生物組成層次的2048 Game\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"chihhsiangchien.github.io\" data-og-source-url=\"https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html\" data-og-url=\"https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://chihhsiangchien.github.io/2048/index.html\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">生物組成層次的2048 Game</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">chihhsiangchien.github.io</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">2. 분류 단계 수박 게임</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de1dc665eb3beda4163de71e064746f44793356c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"261\" height=\"323\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de1dc665eb3beda4163de71e064746f44793356c\" data-origin-width=\"701\" data-origin-height=\"867\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">세포 - 조직 - 기관 - 개체 - 종 - 속 - 과 - 목 - 강 - 문 - 계</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">분류 단계 복습 게임 입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">조작법</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">방향키 이동 + 엔터 낙하 / 키보드 ad 이동 + k 낙하 / 터치로 슬라이드 후 놓기</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">3가지 입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"우T의 과학 - 생물 분류 단계 수박 게임\" data-og-description=\"페이지 업데이트 시간:\" data-og-host=\"sites.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84\" data-og-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sites.google.com/view/biosu-lab/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%EC%84%B1/%EC%83%9D%EB%AC%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A5%98-%EB%8B%A8%EA%B3%84-%EC%88%98%EB%B0%95-%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">우T의 과학 - 생물 분류 단계 수박 게임</p><p class=\"og-desc\">페이지 업데이트 시간:</p><p class=\"og-host\">sites.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">감사합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
